# Lata Enterprises — environment variables
#
# This website needs NO environment variables.
# There is no backend, no API, no database, no form, no analytics and no
# third-party service, so there is nothing secret to configure.
#
# If a service is ever added (for example an enquiry form or analytics),
# add its variable name here WITHOUT a value, and set the real value only
# in Vercel (Project Settings -> Environment Variables) — never commit a
# real value to Git.
#
# Example (not used by this project):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_EXAMPLE_SERVICE_ID=
